  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#999999><size=15>Time has run out.</size></color>


    Suspicion
    clouded your judgment.

    You saw threats everywhere.

    Every answer looked
    like a lie.


    <color=#CCCCCC>In the end, paranoia won.</color>'
